en's toys every Christmas.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2017-02-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Doggie Doo voice over"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>The voice of the long running Doggie Doo TV Advert shown in the UK.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Kids Toys TV advert</h2>\r\n<p>When I was asked to voice this, I asked \"what is Doggie Doo?\" Then I saw it and laughed. I had to voice it.<br>\r\nOne of the first things I did was go and buy it. I've not played it but it sits in the box ready for when my daughter is old enough.<br>\r\nI get texts every year from friends hearing this on the tv.<br>\r\nI had no idea how popular it was going to be. Turns out every year they sell thousands along with <a href=\"/gooey-louie-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Gooey Louie TV Advert\">Gooey Louie</a> and <a href=\"/pig-goes-pop-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pig goes Pop\">Pig goes Pop</a>.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lWHjCGWFerI","title":"Doggie Doo voice over","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/doggie-doo-voice-over.jpg","alt":"doggie-doo-voice-over","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>What on earth is Doggie Doo?</h2>\r\n<p>Been nagging your parents for a puppy? You may change your mind after cleaning up lots of Doggie Doo. With plenty of giggles, watch as the greedy pup gobbles up all the treats and poops on the lawn. If it happens on your turn then standby, you better clear it up! The first player to scoop three poops wins!<br>When it's your turn to feed him you get a chance to pump his lead and see if a 'little present' follows.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Can I help 'Doo' your job?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for an energetic and enthusiastic voiceover? Please get in touch via the form opposite. As I've said, I've voiced countless kids' ads, so take a look at my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover page</a> to get a better idea of what I'm capable of. And if you're planning to release your ad around Christmas time, you may be interested in my <a href=\"/santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a>. I'd be very happy to send a short sample before you book me. Just send a few lines of the script so you can be sure I'm right for the brand or project. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Doggie Doo voice over","pageUrl":"doggie-doo-voice-over"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","774",{"href":"/wirecard-male-voice-over","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":[